  "prefLabel": "Env-Or 807.02 Transfer Before Approval of a Remedial Action Plan",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Or 807.02 Transfer Before Approval of a Remedial Action Plan. As specified in RSA 147-F:17, II, if the transfer of the property is made before approval of a remedial action plan, the successor owner, upon receipt of an affirmative eligibility determination and payment of the program participation fee, shall become a program participant as provided in RSA 147-F:17, II(a) through (c).\n\nSource. #8809, eff 1-26-07; ss by #10833, eff 6-1-15; ss by #14421, eff 11-4-25, EXPIRES: 11-4-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-or800.html"
